WEBVTT

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:06.480
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:10.470
I was taken to this place 
called the Digital World,

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:13.460
where I met Shoutmon and 
lots of other Digimon.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:19.860
This world is having a lot of trouble 
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:27.070
Using the power of the legendary 
Digimon, MarineAngemon,

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:30.440
and with help from Dorulumon, 
we were able to rescue Archelomon.

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:44.390
At last, we defeated the Bagra Army

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:46.260
led by Neptunemon.

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:54.000
<b>Enemy?                              The battle begins!                              Enemy</b>

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:54.000
<b>Team ?                       Team Taiki                    Team Kiriha</b>

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:54.000
Mysterious
Girl

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:54.000
<b>Enemy?                                    Enemy?

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:54.000
Rival

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:54.000
Protagonist

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:54.000
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:50.820
And ChibiKamemon joined our team!

00:00:54.480 --> 00:01:03.010
<b>A Volcanic Digimon's Big Explosion!</b>

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:59.040
A Volcanic Digimon's Big Explosion!

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:11.800
So this is the third area, 
the Magma Zone?

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:20.290
Looks like it's a volcanic area.

00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:23.880
I don't like this place. 
It looks dangerous.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:25.010
Plus...

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:26.380
Something stinks.

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:28.100
You got that right, Brother!

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.710
It smells like rotten eggs!

00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:32.970
Yeah, Brother!

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:35.300
It's sulfur.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.370
Sulfur?

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:38.570
It is a volcanic area, after all.

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:40.560
I bet there are hot springs nearby.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:41.650
Hot springs?!

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:43.280
I love hot springs!

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:45.830
Let's get in now! Right now!

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:47.590
I get first dibs!

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:49.270
I'm so in!

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:52.640
A lady's gotta keep up her 
appearance, after all!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.880
It's so revitalizing.

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:02.130
Not bad at all.

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:05.030
This is starting to feel pretty good.

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:06.040
Isn't it?

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:08.460
Get in with us, Ballistamon!

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:10.170
I can't. I'll rust.

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:11.840
Then you'd be Ba-rust-amon!

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:16.210
Ah, this feels nice.

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:19.780
I never thought there'd be hot 
springs in the Digital World.

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:39.790
What's the deal?

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:41.230
There! There!

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:43.110
Akari! you pervert!

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:48.790
The Bagra Army?!

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:50.380
Precisely.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:52.520
This is the Imperial 
Bagra Army's territory.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:55.620
And I am the platoon leader, 
DeathMeramon.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:57.160
Perfect timing.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.490
We've been looking for 
some new prisoners.

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:00.690
Prisoners?!

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:01.820
Take them.

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:02.430
Yes, sir!

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:07.690
Fine with me! We'll take you on!

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:08.500
Wait!

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:09.730
What?

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:11.060
First things first.

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:12.830
Let us get dressed!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.570
Good idea...

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:16.670
Magma Bomb!

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.030
Rock Damashi!

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:26.120
The battle's on!

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:29.090
I'll let you handle the rest.

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:31.020
I'm not ready!

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:33.390
Meteor Shower!

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:36.290
Heavy Speaker!

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:37.330
Now!

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.690
We're finally ready!

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.240
A red Xros Loader?

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.170
Shoutmon!

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:49.310
Ballistamon!

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:50.710
DigiXros!

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.170
Shoutmon!

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.220
Ballistamon!

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.830
DigiXros!

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:18.680
Shoutmon X2!

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:21.740
Let 'er rip!

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:25.320
Buddy Blaster!

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:31.250
Optic Laser!

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.190
Way to go, X2!

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:38.420
What are you doing?!

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:44.160
Don't think you've won.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:45.860
Your opponent is me!

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:47.650
X2!

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:49.170
Leave this to me.

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:51.860
Buddy Blaster!

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.070
What?!

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:59.480
Heat Chain!

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:06.270
Shoutmon!

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.710
Ba-rus— Ballistamon!

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.630
That's all you've got?

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.870
Taiki, the sword!

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:12.520
Okay!

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:14.160
Starmon!

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.360
Pickmons!

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:16.790
DigiXros!

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:18.630
Starmon!

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.100
Pickmons!

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.340
Hot spring steamed buns!

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:31.420
Rare Star Sword!

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:38.460
That won't help you!

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:40.620
Flailing Heat Chain!

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:43.830
That's hot!

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:51.030
Akari!

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:54.330
You're...

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:56.470
Cutemon!

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:59.100
There are more of you?

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:04.040
<i>We can't dodge it!</i>

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:09.380
Taiki!

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:15.050
Did you think a human could 
defend against my attack?

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:15.920
Time to finish you.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.510
Drill Buster!

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:29.630
Dorulumon!

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:31.140
What? Dorulumon?

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:34.310
<i>That's...</i>

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:36.600
<i>BlueMeramon.</i>

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:39.090
Why, you...

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:40.380
Pull back for now!

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:41.810
Yes, sir!

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:48.250
They're gone.

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:54.770
You're so reckless, Taiki.

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:55.820
That's right!

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:58.680
But Dorulumon really saved me.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.000
That Drill Buster was awesome!

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:04.220
We could've won on our own!

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:06.410
Don't talk like that.

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:10.790
Thanks, Cutemon.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.680
You're welcome.

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:15.710
So anyway, Cutemon, what are you

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:17.400
and Dorulumon on a journey for?

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:19.740
It's him.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:22.860
He just goes wherever the 
wind and his mood take him.

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:24.820
If you know the answer, then don't ask.

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:30.730
There's actually some reason, 
isn't there, Dorulumon?

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:33.130
It's none of your business.

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:35.040
Always playing the tough guy...

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.060
Well...

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.950
We're actually on a journey 
in search of my parents.

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:43.170
Your parents?

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:46.280
It happened six months ago.

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:50.710
I was traveling alone in the wilderness,

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:53.100
when...

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:56.370
<i>I don't have any money!</i>

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:59.690
<i>Then we'll make you our henchman.</i>

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:02.330
<i>No! I have something to do!</i>

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.660
<i>Shut your mouth!</i>

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:09.010
<i>Wh-What are you doing?!</i>

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:11.140
<i>You're making too much noise.</i>

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.400
<i>I can't even take a nap.</i>

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:22.440
<i>Um... Thank you for saving me!</i>

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:23.720
<i>I don't need your thanks.</i>

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:30.350
<i>Stop following me.</i>

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:45.090
<i>Stop following me!</i>

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:46.100
<i>No!</i>

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:49.590
<i>I've already decided to go with you!</i>

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:51.140
<i>Don't decide that on your own!</i>

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:53.850
<i>Get away from me. I hate kids.</i>

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:56.430
<i>I'm not a kid!</i>

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.810
<i>You said you had something to do.</i>

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.120
<i>Yes.</i>

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:06.560
<i>What is it?</i>

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:09.270
<i>I'm searching for my parents.</i>

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:11.260
<i>What do you mean?</i>

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:15.120
<i>The village we lived in was attacked.</i>

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:21.210
<i>I was separated from my parents.</i>

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:24.320
<i>Who attacked you?</i>

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:26.340
<i>The Bagra Army.</i>

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:35.480
<i>If you sleep there, 
you'll be attacked again.</i>

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:51.660
Dorulumon never again told 
me to stop following him.

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:56.540
So Dorulumon's actually very kind.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:00.950
Hey, Dorulumon, 
you should travel with us.

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:03.820
No, thanks.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.250
Why not?

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:09.090
Maybe we can help Cutemon, too.

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:10.440
That's right, you—

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:13.250
I don't like being tied down.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:14.160
What?

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:16.360
We wouldn't tie you down.

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:18.650
I'm asking you to be our friend.

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:20.980
Not interested. Let's go, Cutemon.

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:22.430
But...

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:25.450
If you want to stay with 
them, be my guest.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:26.370
I won't stop you.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.050
Wait!

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:30.710
Cutemon!

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:34.480
Just when we had become friends...

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:41.690
Taiki?

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:47.420
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:49.760
They may be made up of data,

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:52.530
but they're our precious 
friends who cry, laugh,

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:54.630
and fight for us.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.110
Join us in our world of adventure

00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:00.270
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:11:00.270 --> 00:11:01.340
DigiXros!

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:41.140
What? Humans?!

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:42.230
Yes.

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:45.260
One of them had a red Xros Loader.

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:49.730
He must be the one Lord 
Tactimon told me about.

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:53.200
But if you've captured him, it's ours.

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:57.650
W-Well... Unfortunately, we lost them...

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:02.130
You...

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:04.280
You...

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:08.770
...lost them?!

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:12.940
Boom! Bang! Boom!

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:14.000
This is not good.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:16.730
We have to calm Lord 
AncientVolcamon's rage!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.320
Perhaps I should chill out and 
approach this more calmly.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:34.180
DeathMeramon, make sure 
you get them next time.

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:35.290
Yes, sir!

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:40.780
Why are you following me?

00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:42.630
We're just going in the same direction.

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:48.770
Taiki, why are you so stuck on him?

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:50.440
I had a dream...

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:54.200
He was fighting by our side.

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:57.750
So I know we should be 
traveling together.

00:13:58.530 --> 00:13:59.850
Just so you don't forget...

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:03.430
I'm your number one partner!

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:05.850
Brother is surprisingly...

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:07.530
...the jealous type.

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:09.360
What's that?

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.730
Looks like ruins.

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:27.810
What are you doing?!

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:29.790
Please don't!

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:31.620
Prairiemon has a fever.

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:33.080
Please let him rest.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.790
No! Get to work!

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:35.800
Hold on.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:37.560
He can't help it if he has a fever.

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:42.140
You still haven't found the Code Crown?

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:44.030
Speed up the search!

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:46.830
But that would put the 
prisoners' lives at risk.

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:49.350
They're just sacrificial pawns anyway.

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:50.990
If we run low, we just find more.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.200
Am I wrong?

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:54.000
No...

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:00.050
So this is what he meant by "prisoners."

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:01.960
But what is he making them do?

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:04.150
Search for the Code Crown, I bet.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.950
He gained control of this Zone, 
but couldn't find it.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:12.000
The Code Crown sometimes 
falls from the sky,

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:14.360
and other times it's hidden somewhere.

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:17.350
Not that it matters to me.

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:19.730
I can't turn my back on them.

00:15:20.740 --> 00:15:22.570
Only one thing matters right now.

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:28.740
To save all those Digimon 
being forced to work!

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:31.440
I knew this would happen...

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:33.510
That's Taiki for you.

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:35.350
Sounds good! Let's do it!

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:38.630
Dorulumon, please help us.

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:40.720
What did I tell you? I am the wind.

00:15:41.490 --> 00:15:44.020
The wind just quietly blows through.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.570
Playing tough again?

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.530
What's wrong, Cutemon?

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:58.470
I'm worried about Taiki and the others.

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:02.900
Aren't you worried, too?

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:06.710
Don't you really want 
to work with Taiki?

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:08.850
Give it up. I...

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:14.450
What's wrong?

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:17.560
Who are you guys?!

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:18.760
Allies of...

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:20.130
Justice!

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.760
Okay, we're going in!

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:30.170
Where's the boss?

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:33.870
I never thought you'd 
come to me yourselves.

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:40.040
This time, I will make you prisoners!

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:41.590
Taiki, DigiXros us!

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:42.210
Yeah!

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:43.250
I won't let you!

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:45.850
Heavy Metal Fire!

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:49.020
No!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:49.820
Go now!

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:57.000
Catch and release!

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:57.710
Got it!

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:00.260
You won't escape!

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:01.670
Akari!

00:17:01.670 --> 00:17:03.670
Give that to me!

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:06.970
We're in trouble!

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:17.370
Dorulu Tornado!

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:29.690
Dorulumon! You came to help us!

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:32.820
You sure are a nice guy...

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:34.400
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:39.000
I came because I heard 
Cutemon's parents are here.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:40.750
That's right.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:41.960
Cutemon!

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:45.810
<i>What? My parents are at the dig site?</i>

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:49.950
<i>Yes. They said they were separated 
from their son at the village.</i>

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:54.400
<i>Hang in there! 
I'll fix you up right away!</i>

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.570
<i>Those Bagra Army guys are the worst.</i>

00:17:57.570 --> 00:17:59.290
<i>When they can't use us anymore,</i>

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:02.480
<i>they throw us away like garbage.</i>

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:05.580
Taiki, here's your Xros Loader.

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:06.580
Thanks.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.830
All right, now that Dorulumon's here...

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:13.440
Shoutmon!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:14.470
Ballistamon!

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:15.510
Dorulumon!

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:20.330
DigiXros!

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:28.150
Shoutmon!

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:31.670
Ballistamon!

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:34.960
Dorulumon!

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:44.600
DigiXros!

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:12.960
Shoutmon X3!

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:14.770
You...

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:16.200
Go!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.740
All right!

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:26.310
